{
  "info": {
    "name": "QUICKPATCH — Registro de Técnico (SCRUM-56) y Aislamiento por Tenant (SCRUM-62)",
    "description": "Suite automatizada de pruebas del Sprint 4 para verificar:\n1. SCRUM-56: Registro legítimo de técnico, validación de unicidad de documento (409) y correo (409), validación de esquema (400), consulta de perfil propio (/v1/users/me con verificationStatus: pendiente) y restricción RBAC para creación de solicitudes (403).\n2. SCRUM-62: Aislamiento estricto multi-tenant (RLS) en lectura de solicitudes cruzadas (404 Not Found), aislamiento de catálogo entre Tenant Alfa y Tenant Beta, y acceso positivo para el tenant propietario.\nVariables: baseUrl (https://qa.quickpatch.internal o http://localhost:8080 en local).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "documento",
      "value": "CC-1020304050",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "correoTecnico",
      "value": "tecnico.qa@quickpatch.test",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tecnicoToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAlfa",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenBeta",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "solicitudAlfaId",
      "value": "sr-qa-001",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. SCRUM-56 — Registro y Perfil de Técnico (Identity)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Registro exitoso de técnico (verificationStatus: pendiente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-Id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Channel-Id",
                "value": "quickpatch-mobile"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/technician",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register",
                "technician"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{correoTecnico}}\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordTecnico123*\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Carlos Alberto Técnico\",\n  \"phone\": \"3109876543\",\n  \"documentId\": \"{{documento}}\",\n  \"specialtyId\": \"3f1c2a4e-8d7b-4c1a-9e2f-5b6a7c8d9e01\",\n  \"role\": \"tecnico\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const ts = Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('documento', 'CC-' + String(ts).slice(-8));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('correoTecnico', 'tecnico.qa.' + ts + '@quickpatch.test');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('[SCRUM-56] 201 Created para registro legítimo', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('[SCRUM-56] Rol verificado como tecnico', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('tecnico'));",
                  "pm.test('[SCRUM-56 / RN-U1] verificationStatus inicial es pendiente', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().verificationStatus).to.eql('pendiente'));",
                  "pm.test('[Auditoría] Correlation ID presente en cabecera', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Correlation-Id')).to.not.be.empty);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Rechazo por documento de identidad repetido → 409 Conflict",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-Id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Channel-Id",
                "value": "quickpatch-mobile"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/technician",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register",
                "technician"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"otro.correo.repetido@quickpatch.test\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordTecnico123*\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Intento Duplicado Documento\",\n  \"phone\": \"3112223344\",\n  \"documentId\": \"{{documento}}_repetido\",\n  \"role\": \"tecnico\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('[SCRUM-56] 409 Conflict ante documento repetido', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "pm.test('[RFC 9457] Problem Details con correlationId', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/problem+json');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('correlationId');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('[Contrato] Tipo de error documento-registrado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().type).to.match(/\\/documento-registrado$/));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Rechazo por correo electrónico repetido → 409 Conflict",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-Id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
